 NoOrYesWithNestedQuestion;myGuiParms;msg;parms;style
⍝ "No-or-Yes" dialog with a complex (nested) question in error style and an additional caption
 myGuiParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico'))
 msg←'Are you really sure about this?' '' 'This does not look right.'
 msg,←'In fact I think it is total rubbish.' 'I have never seen something similarly stupid.'
 msg,←'' 'I suggest you reconsider your decision.'
 parms←##.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForNoOrYes
 parms.addToCaption←'My caption'
 parms.style←##.APLGUI.Enums.DialogStyles.Error
 parms myGuiParms ##.APLGUI.Dialogs.NoOrYes msg
